WEBVTT

00:07:59.308 --> 00:08:04.230
And we loved that by cutting
through the original, historic,

00:08:04.271 --> 00:08:06.065
extraordinary structure,

00:08:06.065 --> 00:08:09.693
we could expose and share
the building's idiosyncrasies.

00:08:10.778 --> 00:08:13.864
And like these nooks and crannies,

00:08:13.864 --> 00:08:16.909
they help to give
the project its soulfulness.

00:08:17.701 --> 00:08:22.122
And on the top is a sculpture garden
with a glass floor.

00:08:22.623 --> 00:08:26.669
And if you see those babies
on the glass just there,

00:08:26.669 --> 00:08:28.212
this is their view.